[{"title":"予独宿太平山房果清上人远顾云欲复归宗寺予再三难之渠心甚坚予熟察其愿力学力必有合也漫书三绝赠之 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"宝地久无狮子吼，野狐时复出蒿莱。\n回看佛骨青霄上，照彻寒山万劫灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22190,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同虞汝薇游太云寺","author":"邹元标","text":"僧依水竹情偏寂，客到空庭念亦休。\n尔我相看无片语，心随明月大江流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22191,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再游灵谷寺时邓定宇少宰孟莲渚通参杨止庵符卿同游 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"题诗曾记昔年游，一别俄看已十秋。\n松桧参天人境静，会心无语万缘休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22192,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再游灵谷寺时邓定宇少宰孟莲渚通参杨止庵符卿同游 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"寺在钟陵最僻处，千年香火志公开。\n无心更觅空王法，何日吟诗此再来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22193,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题无学卷兼柬三怀上人时同寓匡庐 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"见说栖霞曾住世，忽闻飞锡在匡庐。\n非生非死应须识，莫向岩头又著书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22194,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题无学卷兼柬三怀上人时同寓匡庐 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"持经为母到西台，五两风轻一苇开。\n月照蒲团猿鹤静，好骑白鹿再归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22195,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题无学卷兼柬三怀上人时同寓匡庐 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"乞归久作青山主，饱食閒眠学懒慵。\n春来准拟岩前卧，瀑布还当第几峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22196,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳渠翁与先大夫双崖公为儒连蹇世皆笑之而二老自喜今后人犹世儒业不废谁谓儒可笑哉惟贤世兄过我感今追昔口占奉勖","author":"邹元标","text":"与君数世是通家，仁厚诗书泽未涯。\n天意茫茫那可问，相逢且自惜年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22197,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓝生扩之常虑予召毁故作此解之 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"一入云山百念轻，蒲团坐破竟无生。\n碧潭深处藏名好，纵是孤寒梦亦清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22198,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓝生扩之常虑予召毁故作此解之 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"看来万事羽毛轻，冰玉泠泠出世情。\n不逐众生留口业，祗将心事托神明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22199,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓝生扩之常虑予召毁故作此解之 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"怪得叔孙毁仲尼，忧心悄悄亦何为。\n死生进退浑忘却，无恙青天祗自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22200,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓝生扩之常虑予召毁故作此解之 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"人间毁誉寻常耳，定脚江门我最真。\n千古真人千古眼，尧仁蹠暴总纤尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22201,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄仪部庭翠 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"江头系艇苦旬馀，无奈前旌望竟虚。\n春鸟嘤嘤春水绿，与君相见更何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22202,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄仪部庭翠 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"君依珠斗侍明君，我傍岩头领白云。\n心境纤毫原不二，年年风月自平分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22203,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄仪部庭翠 其三","author":"邹元标","text":"懒慵高卧钓台深，白鹤飞鸣递好音。\n无限心情难寄语，独将长啸振空林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22204,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄仪部庭翠 其四","author":"邹元标","text":"年来白业事如何，驹隙光阴荏苒过。\n莫道心斋无个事，悬崖险峻误人多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22205,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠梁绍东画士 其一","author":"邹元标","text":"问君能不绘予心，只在青天月下寻。\n莫怪病骸还偃蹇，试看野鹤在松林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22206,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠梁绍东画士 其二","author":"邹元标","text":"莲花绰约淤泥里，肯逐东风逞艳姿。\n外直中通元不染，漫将彩笔寄予思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":22207,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac8589789